{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ac6d7eaa-fc82-830f-a696-00a517f424cf",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:30:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:27:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:27:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, hello. My name is George Wilcox. I am calling about my trash bin. The truck break it this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no. Okay, sorry to hear that. Let me grab some notes here. So the truck damaged your bin this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Today, Monday, maybe eight o'clock. I hear the truck, I go outside after, and the lid is crack off and one side is smash. Bin is no good now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Was it the trash bin or the recycling one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash one. The big one with wheels. The wheel is also bent, it cannot roll."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, trash cart, lid cracked, side crushed, wheel bent. And what's the address where it was picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:28:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "94 Spring Street. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:28:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "94 Spring Street. Got it. Is it the kind of damage where you think the truck ran over it, or the arm grabbed it too hard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think the arm. It was at the curb, not in the road. Maybe they grab too hard and drop it. Then it is on the side like this, broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens. Alright, I'll put it in as a damaged cart from collection, and we'll get a replacement sorted out for you. Usually that goes through the crew supervisor, so it might take a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. Meantime I have trash already in it, and more in the kitchen. I put the bag in a box now, but not so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:29:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, understood. If you need to, you can set bags out on your collection day in the meantime. Just tie them up good so nothing gets loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. When is the next pickup? I am not sure, because of the holiday last week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the holiday can push things around. Let me look at your street. Spring Street, Fifth Ward... so your regular day is Monday, and that's what you had today. Next one would be next Monday, the eighth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next Monday. So one week. Okay. That is long time with broken bin, but okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:29:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll note it so they know you're waiting on a cart before then, so hopefully it gets there sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:29:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Because I like to sit on the back steps after dinner, you know, and I do not want to look at the trash pile there. Only small thing, but I like the evening quiet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:29:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fair. Nobody wants a pile of bags back there. Alright, can I get a phone number in case the supervisor needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0150, George Wilcox, 94 Spring Street, damaged trash cart. Did I get all that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:30:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, George. Sorry again about the cart. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T10:30:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
